**Task C8: Style node pills and node activity messages**

Add these new CSS rules at the END of the file, after the last existing rule:

```css
/* ── Node Pills (inline interactive node indicators) ─────────────── */

.sd-node-pill {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  padding: 2px 10px 2px 7px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-family: var(--sd-font-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pill-color) 12%, transparent);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--pill-color) 25%, transparent);
  color: var(--pill-color);
  transition: background var(--sd-transition), border-color var(--sd-transition);
  white-space: nowrap;
  margin: 0 3px;
  vertical-align: middle;
}

.sd-node-pill:hover {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pill-color) 22%, transparent);
  border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pill-color) 45%, transparent);
}

.sd-node-pill[style*="cursor: pointer"]:active {
  transform: scale(0.97);
}

.sd-node-pill__dot {
  width: 5px;
  height: 5px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--pill-color);
  box-shadow: 0 0 5px color-mix(in srgb, var(--pill-color) 55%, transparent);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* Node activity message (shown in chat when tools touch nodes) */
.sd-message--node-activity {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 6px;
  padding: var(--sd-space-sm) var(--sd-space-xl);
  background: transparent;
  font-size: 11px;
  opacity: 0.85;
}

.sd-node-activity__label {
  font-family: var(--sd-font-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--sd-text-muted);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  margin-right: 4px;
}

/* Node pills inside the stage bar */
.sd-stage-bar .sd-node-pill {
  font-size: 10px;
  padding: 1px 7px 1px 5px;
  margin-left: 4px;
}

/* Long paragraphs get extra bottom margin for scanability */
.sd-para-long {
  margin-bottom: var(--sd-space-xl) !important;
}
```

Make sure the rules are appended cleanly at the end of the file.

